{"id":"657579","name":"虾泥藕夹","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"","cover":"images/657579/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"藕","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"虾","amount":"300g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备鲜虾。","img":"images/657579/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"剥成虾仁。","img":"images/657579/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用刀背剁成虾泥。","img":"images/657579/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"虾泥里面放一匙淀粉，一个蛋清，一匙胡椒粉，搅打上劲。","img":"images/657579/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"两个藕片，夹一些虾泥。","img":"images/657579/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"地瓜粉加一些五香粉。","img":"images/657579/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加水搅成糊，然后加一点油。","img":"images/657579/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"藕夹裹上面糊。","img":"images/657579/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"热油下锅炸。","img":"images/657579/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"酥脆又鲜香。","img":"images/657579/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}